    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A local multiplayer Tank Battle Arena! (Steam Remote Play works too!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the <strong>16 Solo Missions</strong>, or in one of the <strong>12 Multiplayer Battle Arenas</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Arena is a PvP mode that can be played 2-4 players; Free For All or with Co-Op Teams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with any of <strong>8 different characters</strong> with their own play-style and abilities, and their cool unique looking tank-like-machine! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are four distinct environments full of <strong>destructible elements</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029560/extras/543bdd870e6cffdc3c226b7bd18dc5ab.poster.avif?t=1736633286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029560/extras/543bdd870e6cffdc3c226b7bd18dc5ab.webm?t=1736633286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029560/extras/543bdd870e6cffdc3c226b7bd18dc5ab.mp4?t=1736633286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A local multiplayer Tank Battle Arena! (Steam Remote Play works too!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the <strong>16 Solo Missions</strong>, or in one of the <strong>12 Multiplayer Battle Arenas</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Arena is a PvP mode that can be played 2-4 players; Free For All or with Co-Op Teams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with any of <strong>8 different characters</strong> with their own play-style and abilities, and their cool unique looking tank-like-machine! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are four distinct environments full of <strong>destructible elements</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029560/extras/543bdd870e6cffdc3c226b7bd18dc5ab.poster.avif?t=1736633286\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029560/extras/543bdd870e6cffdc3c226b7bd18dc5ab.webm?t=1736633286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029560/extras/543bdd870e6cffdc3c226b7bd18dc5ab.mp4?t=1736633286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
